• This is a remote position;

• Design, build and maintain C++ code;

• Work on and suggest improvements on extensions and modules of the existing products;

• Be proactive in finding solutions to problems;

• Mentor and help develop the team.

Requirements

• Computer Sciences or Equivalent degree;

• 5+ years of experience with C++;

• Knowledge of Machine Learning Techniques;

• Experience in software development lifecycle;

• Knowledge and experience in working with cloud service provides (AWS);

