We Are:

RTB House is a next-generation performance demand-side platform (DSP) that uses proprietary Deep Learning AI algorithms to help brands grow. The company is the market leader in driving performance using Deep Learning across the entire purchase funnel.

Founded in 2012 and now operating in 90+ markets, RTB House has always been private-by-design. It embraces first-party advertising and a relentless approach to innovation. RTB House offers end-to-end Deep Learning-powered AdTech products and solutions to maximize conversion, drive new customer acquisition, create engagement, and fuel long-term demand for a global base of clients.

In 2026, RTB House launched rtb.com, a self-service platform specifically designed to allow small and medium-sized businesses and agencies to deploy auto-built creatives and maximize performance on any budget.

Our Spanish team consists of 25 people and is an integral part of our company’s EMEA presence. We combine local expertise with our broader company vision, ensuring innovative solutions that align with diverse market needs.

The Account Management team is crucial in driving our company’s success, working collaboratively with our clients to make sure that they can get the best outcomes from their partnership with RTB House. Maximising revenue from existing clients by convincing them to use our full suite of products and helping the new business team to close and onboard brand-new clients is a crucial role. As an Account Manager, you will play a substantial role in building an excellent relationship with our existing and new clients. You are an important element in the client's journey. You will work closely with the sales team and technical account management team.&nbsp;

Why RTB House?

If you are looking for a place where you can excel at developing relationships with your client base by becoming their trusted advisor and most valued vendor, then RTB House might be the right fit for you.

