• Adhere to the company goals related to campaign management (i.e. keep an eye on campaign margin and scale);

• Respond to customer requests and inquiries in a professional and timely manner;

• Regularly report campaign status for the largest clients and provide improvement ideas to the direct manager in terms of cross sell &amp; upsell;

• Take care of customer success and long-term relationship;

• Provide specific information regarding company’s services and products;

• Assist customers in the process of launching ad campaigns;

• Obtain, review and process orders; ensure timely payments for our services.

